 370:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \param [in]    value  Value to reverse
 371:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \return               Reversed value
